==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
{{af|is|sam-|mála|t1=co-, same|t2=indefinite genitive plural of {{m|is|mál|t=speech, affair}}}}, thus "of the same affairs".

===Adjective===
{{is-adj|indecl}}

# [[agreed]], in [[agreement]], I [[agree]] {{+obj|is|dat}}
#: {{syn|is|sáttur}}
#: {{ant|is|ósammála}}
#: {{ux|is|Ég er ekki '''sammála'''.|I dis'''agree'''.}}
#: {{ux|is|Hún var '''sammála''' mér.|She '''agreed''' with me.}}
#: {{ux|is|Hann er hræðilegur söngvari! — '''Sammála'''.|He's a horrible singer! — '''I agree'''.}}

